# test/remote/logo.k4r -- LOGO: the turtle comes up, draws, and BYE comes home.
#     tools/k4510-remote run test/remote/logo.k4r
# the machine's own colours first: a STARTUP.BAT may load another palette (Doc, 2026-09-15)
type PALETTE RESET\n
wait 1
type LOGO\n
expect "the turtle is home" 10
type REPEAT 8 [FD 60 RT 45]\n
wait 3
shot logo
type BYE\n
expect "/HOME]" 10
